BlackthornCity_Gym_Text_ALLENIntro::
    .string "Can your partner handle a\n"
    .string "well-trained dragon?$"

BlackthornCity_Gym_Text_ALLENDefeat::
    .string "Your trust made the difference!$"

BlackthornCity_Gym_Text_ALLENAfter::
    .string "CLAIR will test that trust\n"
    .string "against her KINGDRA.$"

BlackthornCity_Gym_Text_FRANIntro::
    .string "Our dragons train for years.\n"
    .string "Show me your resolve!$"

BlackthornCity_Gym_Text_FRANDefeat::
    .string "Your partner refused to give up!$"

BlackthornCity_Gym_Text_FRANAfter::
    .string "The elder values your choices\n"
    .string "as much as your battle skills.$"

BlackthornCity_Gym_Text_ClairIntro::
    .string "CLAIR: You silenced the ROCKETS.\n"
    .string "Now face my dragon partners!\p"
    .string "This final GYM challenge will\n"
    .string "test the bond you have built.$"

BlackthornCity_Gym_Text_ClairDefeat::
    .string "You won... But a trainer needs\n"
    .string "more than strength alone.$"

BlackthornCity_Gym_Text_ClairTrial::
    .string "Meet the elder in DRAGON'S DEN.\n"
    .string "Accept his test with honesty.\p"
    .string "After his approval, I will\n"
    .string "recognize your final badge.$"

BlackthornCity_Gym_Text_ClairBefore::
    .string "Finish PRYCE's GYM challenge.\n"
    .string "Then silence the RADIO TOWER.$"

BlackthornCity_Gym_Text_ClairAfter::
    .string "The elder recognized your bond.\n"
    .string "You earned the RISINGBADGE.\p"
    .string "Stay worthy of the trust your\n"
    .string "POKEMON place in you.$"

